5. File Discovery
The Python program first identifies the main input directory and traverses the folders inside it.
pathlib.Path is used to work with files and folders.
The process identifies:
•	Kitchen folders
•	Excel files
•	File names
•	Parent kitchen folder
•	Relative file path
•	Last modified time
The relative path is used in the processing log so that the same file can be identified later.
