21. Why Lists of DataFrames Are Used
Each kitchen may contain its own version of the same worksheet.
For example:
ATC → COM
BBL → COM
GMB → COM
SKLM → COM
VSP → COM
Instead of immediately writing every individual DataFrame to a separate file, the processed DataFrames are stored in a list:
COM = []
Each processed COM DataFrame is appended:
COM.append(df)
Once all kitchen files have been processed, the DataFrames can be combined into one dataset.
