22. Data Consolidation
After processing all relevant files, DataFrames belonging to the same category are combined using pd.concat().
Example:
final_COM = pd.concat(COM, ignore_index=True)
This creates one consolidated COM dataset containing data from multiple kitchens.
ignore_index=True creates a new continuous index for the combined DataFrame.
The same approach can be used for the other datasets.
