27. Error Handling
Errors during ETL processing are captured with information about the file and worksheet being processed.
Example:
except Exception as e:

    print("Folder:", subfiles.parent.stem)
    print("File:", subfiles.name)
    print("Sheet:", sheetname)
    print("Error type:", type(e).__name__)
    print("Error message:", e)

    raise
This provides useful debugging information such as:
Folder: ATC
File: Maintenance and Utilities.xlsx
Sheet: Deisel utilisation
Error type: KeyError
Error message: 'Date'
This makes it easier to identify the exact source of an ETL failure.
