28. Performance Monitoring
Processing time is measured using perf_counter().
Example:
start = perf_counter()

# processing

end = perf_counter()

print("Read time:", end - start)
This helps identify which files or worksheets take longer to process.
Performance monitoring is particularly important because Excel files can contain large used ranges caused by formatting or unused rows and columns.
